# archify output: regenerate from the JSON sources with the archify skill:
#   node <archify>/bin/archify.mjs finalize <type> docs/diagrams/src/<name>.json docs/diagrams/src/<name>.html --quality showcase
#   (add --repo-root . when the JSON has meta.repository). Each PNG is a light-theme headless Chromium screenshot of that HTML.
*.html
*.delivery.json
*.finalize*.json
*.browser-check.json
